WEBVTT

00:00:04.354 --> 00:00:06.714
See? You see?

00:00:06.794 --> 00:00:08.474
You don't see it?

00:00:10.714 --> 00:00:12.954
He moves!
Right there!

00:00:13.634 --> 00:00:16.554
Wait, wait!
Right there!

00:00:16.634 --> 00:00:18.234
Right as I'm
sitting down!

00:00:18.314 --> 00:00:20.074
I don't know
how he does it,

00:00:20.154 --> 00:00:22.394
but there's no tack
before he moves

00:00:22.474 --> 00:00:24.314
and after he moves,
there's a tack.

00:00:24.394 --> 00:00:26.594
Coincidence?
I think not!

00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:30.834
Bernie...

00:00:30.954 --> 00:00:32.514
Don't "Bernie" me.

00:00:32.634 --> 00:00:34.714
(SCREAMING)
This little rat
is guilty!

00:00:35.154 --> 00:00:37.674
You and your son
can go now, Mrs. Parr.

00:00:37.754 --> 00:00:39.234
I'm sorry
for the trouble.

00:00:39.314 --> 00:00:42.234
You're letting
him go again?
He's guilty!

00:00:42.314 --> 00:00:45.994
You can see it on
his smug little face.
Guilty, I say, guilty!

00:00:49.674 --> 00:00:52.714
Dash, this is
the third time
this year

00:00:52.794 --> 00:00:54.474
you've been sent
to the office.

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:56.674
We need to find
a better outlet.

00:00:56.754 --> 00:00:59.114
A more
constructive outlet.

00:00:59.194 --> 00:01:01.954
Maybe I could,
if you'd let me
go out for sports.

00:01:02.034 --> 00:01:04.194
Honey, you know
why we can't do that.

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:08.794
I promise I'll slow up.
I'll only be the best
by a tiny bit.

00:01:08.874 --> 00:01:10.794
Dashiell Robert Parr,

00:01:10.874 --> 00:01:13.114
you are an incredibly
competitive boy.

00:01:13.194 --> 00:01:14.394
And a bit of a showoff.

00:01:14.474 --> 00:01:16.634
The last thing you
need is temptation.

00:01:16.714 --> 00:01:18.714
You always say,
"Do your best."

00:01:18.794 --> 00:01:20.034
But you don't
really mean it.

00:01:20.154 --> 00:01:22.394
Why can't I do the best
that I can do?

00:01:22.474 --> 00:01:25.034
Right now, honey,
the world just
wants us to fit in,

00:01:25.154 --> 00:01:27.714
and to fit in,
we just gotta be
like everybody else.

00:01:27.794 --> 00:01:30.674
Dad always said our
powers were nothing
to be ashamed of.

00:01:30.754 --> 00:01:32.554
Our powers
made us special.

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:34.354
Everyone's special, Dash.

00:01:34.434 --> 00:01:37.034
Which is another way
of saying no one is.

00:01:42.994 --> 00:01:44.554
(BELL RINGS)

00:01:47.554 --> 00:01:49.074
BOY: Rydinger,
where you headed?

00:01:51.674 --> 00:01:53.714
GIRL: Hi, Tony.
Hey.

00:01:53.794 --> 00:01:55.514
"Hey, Tony,
can I carry
your books?"

00:01:55.594 --> 00:01:57.514
That's kind of funny.

00:01:57.634 --> 00:02:00.354
"Hey, Tony,
do you play football?"

00:02:03.154 --> 00:02:05.554
BOY: Tony,
I thought we were
gonna go swimming.

00:02:07.434 --> 00:02:08.834
He looked at me.

00:02:08.914 --> 00:02:09.994
(CAR HORN HONKING)

00:02:10.074 --> 00:02:12.794
DASH: Come on, Violet!

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:16.914
(HORNS HONKING,
PEOPLE YELLING)

00:02:25.794 --> 00:02:27.434
(CAR RATTLING)

00:02:34.434 --> 00:02:35.714
(GROANS)

00:02:36.354 --> 00:02:39.274
(MUTTERING) Darn kids.
Sitting on the driveway...

00:02:40.634 --> 00:02:42.754
Oh, great.

00:02:49.754 --> 00:02:51.434
(UNINTELLIGIBLE MUTTERING)

00:03:09.834 --> 00:03:11.994
(HELEN AND JACK-JACK COOING)

00:03:19.314 --> 00:03:20.674
Mom.

00:03:21.954 --> 00:03:24.234
You're making
weird faces again.

00:03:24.314 --> 00:03:25.594
No, I'm not.

00:03:25.674 --> 00:03:28.074
You make weird faces, honey.

00:03:28.154 --> 00:03:29.834
Do you have to read
at the table?

00:03:30.154 --> 00:03:31.594
Uh-huh. Yeah.

00:03:32.434 --> 00:03:34.674
Smaller bites, Dash.
Yikes!

00:03:34.754 --> 00:03:37.834
Bob, could you help
the carnivore cut
his meat?

00:03:38.834 --> 00:03:43.194
Dash, you have something
you wanna tell your father
about school?

00:03:43.314 --> 00:03:45.354
(NERVOUSLY) Well,
we dissected a frog.

00:03:45.474 --> 00:03:47.114
Dash got sent to
the office again.

00:03:47.194 --> 00:03:48.434
(DISTRACTED) Good. Good.

00:03:48.514 --> 00:03:49.714
No, Bob, that's bad.

00:03:49.834 --> 00:03:50.794
What?

00:03:50.914 --> 00:03:52.954
Dash got sent to
the office again.

00:03:53.034 --> 00:03:54.794
What? What for?
Nothing.

00:03:54.874 --> 00:03:57.554
He put a tack on
the teacher's chair,
during class.

00:03:57.674 --> 00:04:00.714
Nobody saw me.
You could barely
see it on the tape.

00:04:00.794 --> 00:04:03.954
They caught you on tape
and you still got away
with it? Whoa!

00:04:04.034 --> 00:04:06.554
You must have been booking.
How fast were you going?

00:04:06.634 --> 00:04:07.954
We are not
encouraging this.

00:04:08.034 --> 00:04:10.274
I'm not, I'm just
asking how fast...

00:04:10.394 --> 00:04:12.034
Honey!
(CRASH)

00:04:14.394 --> 00:04:17.394
Great. First the car,
now I gotta pay
to fix the table...

00:04:17.474 --> 00:04:19.194
What happened
to the car?

00:04:20.394 --> 00:04:23.234
Here. I'm getting
a new plate.

00:04:24.514 --> 00:04:26.394
So, how about you, Vi?
How was school?

00:04:26.474 --> 00:04:27.794
Nothing to report.

00:04:27.914 --> 00:04:29.314
You've hardly
touched your food.

00:04:29.394 --> 00:04:31.394
I'm not hungry
for meatloaf.

00:04:31.474 --> 00:04:32.994
Well, it is
leftover night.

00:04:33.074 --> 00:04:35.994
We have steak, pasta...
What are you hungry for?

00:04:36.074 --> 00:04:37.754
Tony Rydinger.

00:04:37.834 --> 00:04:38.834
Shut up.

00:04:38.914 --> 00:04:39.994
Well, you are.

00:04:40.074 --> 00:04:41.874
I said, shut up,
you little insect.

00:04:41.954 --> 00:04:42.994
Well, she is.

00:04:43.074 --> 00:04:44.674
Do not shout
at the table.

00:04:44.754 --> 00:04:45.754
Honey!

00:04:45.834 --> 00:04:47.994
BOB: Kids!
Listen to your mother.

00:04:48.914 --> 00:04:51.674
She'd eat if we were
having Tony loaf.

00:04:51.754 --> 00:04:53.514
That's it!

00:04:53.594 --> 00:04:54.754
Stop it!

00:04:55.914 --> 00:04:57.714
DASH: You're
gonna be toast!

00:04:57.794 --> 00:04:59.274
HELEN: Stop running
in the house.

00:04:59.994 --> 00:05:01.274
HELEN: Sit down!

00:05:02.274 --> 00:05:03.554
Hey, no force fields!

00:05:03.634 --> 00:05:04.914
You started it.

00:05:05.034 --> 00:05:07.594
You sit down!
You sit down!

00:05:07.674 --> 00:05:09.074
Violet!

00:05:09.274 --> 00:05:10.274
(SHOUTING IN BACKGROUND)

00:05:10.674 --> 00:05:12.434
(BOB MUTTERING)

00:05:15.394 --> 00:05:17.674
"Simon J. Paladino,

00:05:17.754 --> 00:05:21.874
"longtime advocate
of superhero rights,
is missing"?

00:05:22.434 --> 00:05:24.434
Gazerbeam.

00:05:24.554 --> 00:05:26.674
HELEN: Bob!
It's time to engage.

00:05:26.754 --> 00:05:29.034
Do something!
Don't just stand there!

00:05:29.114 --> 00:05:30.874
I need you
to intervene!

00:05:30.954 --> 00:05:32.114
You want me
to intervene?

00:05:32.234 --> 00:05:34.034
Okay. I'm intervening!

00:05:34.114 --> 00:05:35.474
(ALL SHOUTING)

00:05:35.554 --> 00:05:37.794
Violet, let go
of your brother.

00:05:38.114 --> 00:05:39.714
JACK-JACK: Hello?

00:05:40.594 --> 00:05:42.314
BOB: Get the door.

00:05:42.634 --> 00:05:43.674
Hey, Lucius!

00:05:43.754 --> 00:05:46.154
Hey, Speedo.
Helen, Vi, Jack-Jack.

00:05:46.274 --> 00:05:47.794
Ice of you
to drop by.

00:05:47.914 --> 00:05:49.874
Ha! Never heard
that one before.

00:05:50.474 --> 00:05:51.914
(GARGLING) Lucius!

00:05:51.994 --> 00:05:53.074
LUCIUS: Whoa!

00:05:56.474 --> 00:05:57.634
Ha, ha.
Oh!

00:05:57.714 --> 00:05:59.074
I like it
when it shatters.

00:05:59.154 --> 00:06:00.314
I'll be back later.

00:06:00.714 --> 00:06:01.834
Where are you
two going?

00:06:01.914 --> 00:06:02.994
It's Wednesday.

00:06:03.674 --> 00:06:06.314
Bowling night.
Say hello to Honey
for me, Lucius.

00:06:06.394 --> 00:06:09.114
Will do.
Good night, Helen.
Good night, kids.

